## CometCard — `src/components/ui/comet-card.tsx`

```tsx
<CometCard variant="default">  // max tilt 15°, opacity 0.78 — standard
<CometCard variant="dark">     // max tilt 8°, opacity 0.88 — large content cards
<CometCard variant="subtle">   // minimal border, reduced glow
```

- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion` → disable tilt
- Always `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts` for conditional classes

