## Hard Constraints

- No `tailwind.config.ts` — Tailwind v4 is CSS-first
- No solid white / opaque cards — translucent always
- No fully transparent cards — backdrop-filter always present
- No raw `THREE.Scene` / `THREE.WebGLRenderer` outside R3F
- No `new THREE.*` objects inside `useFrame`
- No chatbot / AI Twin / ChatKit UI in any component
- Always `-webkit-backdrop-filter` paired with `backdrop-filter`
- Always `cn()` for conditional class merging
